### **b. Physics Forces & Calculations**

#### **Gravitational Force Between Two Objects**

```cpp
// force 계산 함수, returns force vector on caller
#include "vector3.h"
#include "space_object.h"

Vector3 gravitational_force_between(const SpaceObject& self, const SpaceObject& other, 
                             float G = 6.67430e-11f)
{
    float r = self.position.distance_to(other.position); // Distance between centers
    if (r < 1e-8f) return Vector3{0,0,0}; // Neglect self-gravity

    float f = G * self.mass * other.mass / (r*r); // Vector form
    Vector3 dir = (other.position - self.position).normalized();
    return f * dir; // Force vector acting on 'self' due to 'other'
}
```

